This file is a placeholder. Replace with the real iwar_data.json.enc generated by the iWAR notebook (Section 9 export). Then git commit and push to redeploy.

Steps:
1. Run the iWAR notebook in Databricks with export_results=yes
2. Download iwar_data.json.enc from /Volumes/dev/bi/adri_iwar_exports/
3. Place it at the root of this repo as iwar_data.json.enc
4. git add iwar_data.json.enc && git commit && git push
